<title>UK: WestLB adds 500 mln marks to Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>WestLB adds 500 mln marks to Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead manager Bankgesellschaft Berling, Landesbank Hessen Thuringen, Norddeutsche Landesbank and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT  * 500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    12.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.18     PAY DATE    27.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.30	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    * FUNGIBLE WITH 1.5 BLN DEM BOND LAUNCHED 03.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    DDF	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  22 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANBRIEF 7502</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
